      "## Authorization and methodology","","The authorization source is **Researcher protocol adoption through the user-submitted execution prompt.** It adopts Design B, the seeded 52-target fold map, all 57 Reference-A auxiliaries, V/F Reference A for all strata, arithmetic-mean centering, normal-consistent MAD primary, sample SD sensitivity, M0 primary, and linear-age M1 sensitivity. This is not represented as historical, supervisor, or institutional approval.","",
      "The implemented outputs are internal sample-referenced task coordinates. No profile estimand, ICC, SEM/MDC, individual classification, bootstrap interval, simulation, prediction, or UI artifact was produced.","",
